<asp:Content ContentPlaceHolderID="PanelContent" runat="server">
  <h3 class="ph">
    <a href="javascript:history.back()">&larr;</a> About StayBuddy
  </h3>
  <p>
    Finding a safe and comfortable place to stay in a new city shouldn't be
    stressful. Our app is designed to make the search for PGs, hostels, and
    rental rooms simple, fast, and reliable.
  </p>
  <p>Our platform allows you to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Search nearby PGs, hostels, and rental rooms</li>
    <li>Filter properties by price, location, room type, and facilities</li>
    <li>View detailed property information with photos and amenities</li>
    <li>Contact property owners directly for quick inquiries</li>
    <li>Save your favorite properties for future reference</li>
  </ul>
  <b>Our Mission</b>
  <p>
    To simplify the accommodation search experience by connecting people with
    verified and affordable living spaces, helping them feel at home wherever
    life takes them.
  </p>
  <b>Our Vision</b>
  <p>
    To become the most trusted accommodation discovery platform, making it
    easier for students, professionals, and travelers to find quality places to
    stay across cities.
  </p>
  <b>Why Choose Us?</b>
  <ul>
    <li>Easy and user-friendly interface</li>
    <li>Smart search and advanced filters</li>
    <li>Budget-friendly recommendations</li>
    <li>Secure and reliable property listings</li>
  </ul>
</asp:Content>